<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Central &amp; South raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Central &amp; South raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Central &amp; South West Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral, and kept the long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 7/8 to 21-1/4.</p>
</text>
